    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;14.06</strong> Clinicopathological differences between functioning and non-functioning somatostatinoma</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Stefano La Rosa",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Feature</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Functioning somatostatinoma</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Non-functioning GEP somatostatin-producing NET</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong>Site</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">Pancreas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">Pancreas, duodenum</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Somatostatinoma syndrome</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Yes</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">No</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong>Symptoms due to mass effects</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">Yes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">Yes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">M:F&nbsp;ratio</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">0.8</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">1.3</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong>Mean age at diagnosis</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">55&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">48&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Mean tumour size</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">51&nbsp;mm</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">24&nbsp;mm</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong>Morphology</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">Trabecular, solid, rarely tubuloacinar</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">Trabecular (pancreas)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">Tubuloacinar (duodenum)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Psammoma bodies</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Rare</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Rare (pancreas)</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Frequent (duodenum)</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong>Genetic syndrome</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">Rare</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\">More frequent: NF1, tuberous sclerosis, MEN1, VHL1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Metastases at diagnosis</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Frequent</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 158.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"211\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210072972;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Frequent</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">GEP, gastroenteropancreatic; MEN1, multiple endocrine neoplasia type&nbsp;1; NET, neuroendocrine tumour; NF1, neurofibromatosis type&nbsp;1; VHL1, von Hippel&ndash;Lindau syndrome type&nbsp;1.</p>",
